Creates a circle of radius [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] at your feet; the circle increases your defense and all saves by [16, 22, 27, 30, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] while dealing [17, 23, 27, 31, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage per turn to everyone else within its radius. The circle lasts [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
